cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "elm-foldbook: a multidimensional spreadsheet prototype with mathematical documents for teaching and research in corporate finance"
abstract: >-
  Research prototype, developed June-December 2024, of a browser-based multidimensional
  spreadsheet written in Elm. Datasets with named dimensions are edited in a pivot-style grid,
  array-level formulas are written in Elm and evaluated by an extended elm-interpreter, and
  documents in elm-markup combine text, MathLive equations and live spreadsheets.
  Version 0.7 dates from 16 December 2024; releases 0.7.1-0.7.2 (2026) add packaging and
  documentation only. elm-foldbook is the pilot of the Impromptu project.
